{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-03_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-03","title":"推定無罪","storyCode":"2-3","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ad61ac4ab499332618eee837661cee6b423d7e736717eb16cb1ba1b044c40a71","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"早く隠れて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"私は……もう行かなくちゃいけないから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……このお人形さん、君たちにあげるね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"実はこれ、お守りなんだ。お母さんから作り方を教えてもらったんだけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"今あげたのは、私の手作りでね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"大事な人を守ってくれますように、って願いを込めてあるんだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供たち","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"そうなんだ……ありがとう、ミーシャお姉ちゃん！　大事にするからね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"ふふ、おりこうさんだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミーシャ","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"さあ、それじゃ隠れてて！　声を出しちゃダメだよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供たち","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うんっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"チッ！　あの感染者め、どこへ行った……！？　おいお前ら、探してこい！　奴はまだ近くにいるはずだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……んん？　こっちは……まだなんかありそうじゃねえか？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"うう～ん……龍門の地形は本当に複雑ですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ペンギン急便の助けを借りられなければ、もっと苦労していた気がします……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"エクシアさんの情報によると、今回の調査対象はこの辺りにいたようなんですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……おや？　向こうに誰かいますね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"！　もしかして、あの人たち……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"やめろってば、このくそ野郎！　は～な～せ～！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うるせえ、だったらさっさと吐け！　奴はどこへ逃げやがった！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"いつまでも知らんぷりが通用するとは思うなよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"くっ、うう……！　お姉ちゃん……龍のお姉ちゃん、どこにいるの……！？　お願い、助けて……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――ミーシャお姉ちゃん、どこに行っちゃったの……！？　ねえ、助けて！　助けてよ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ああ？　なんだお前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"そこから動くんじゃねえ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……警告します。今すぐ、この場から立ち去ってください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"はあ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お前、見ねえ顔だな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一体どっから来やがった？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"どこのどいつか知らねえが、お前なんざちっとも――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――聞く耳を持てないというのなら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あぁ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――っう、ぐあっ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"な、何だ！？　何が起きた……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あ……アーツだ……！　アーツを使いやがったんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"う、うわああっ！　く、くく、来るなっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……二度と、弱い者いじめはしないでください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴徒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ひ、っ……！　ば、化け物！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……化け物……ですか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……さあ、もう出てきても大丈夫ですよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ただ、この辺りは危ないですから、もっと安全な場所に避難してくださいね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子供たち","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うん！　ありがとう、ウサギのお姉ちゃん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ。どうか気をつけて！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"お疲れ様、アーミヤ。状況はどう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"実は先ほど、未登録と思われる感染者を見かけたところで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"へえ。ウルサス人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい。ウルサス人の女の子でした。スラム街の奥へ向かったようですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカさん、この近辺で捜索に当たっているオペレーターを集めてもらえますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"OK、任せて。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それにしても、スラム街を進めば進むほど、周囲の状況が複雑化していきますね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一般市民だけでなく、犯罪者や身元不明の難民たちもいるようですし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"よりいっそう、準備を整えておく必要がありそうです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――お話中すみません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"通信が入りましたので、応答します。少々お待ちいただけますか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――もしもし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ、お疲れ様です。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤさん、近衛局からです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もしかして、チェン隊長ですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"はい。……と、すみません、通信中ですので……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――ええ、未登録の感染者を何名か確認したところで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――そうですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――なるほど、詳細をお伺いできますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――白い髪をした、ウルサス人の少女……ですね。身長は145cm前後、と。名前は……「ミーシャ」でよろしいですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……？　何の連絡でしょうか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――承知しました。失礼、一度報告をしてきます。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤさん。チェン隊長から、感染者捜索の依頼が来ました。白い髪をしたウルサス人の少女だそうです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"見つけ次第、近衛局に連絡してほしいとのことで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"直接お話ししたいので、通信機を貸して頂けますか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――もしもし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"チェン隊長、聞こえますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":true,"text":"ああ、聞こえている。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"本件の捜索目的を伺いたいのですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"チェン","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"説明する必要はない。すぐに取りかかってくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……了解しました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……あっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"通信、切られてしまいました……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ほ～んと、やりにくい相手よねえ。あの隊長さん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あはは……何はともあれ、捜索に取りかかりましょうか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"その前に……立て続けにすみません、アーミヤさん。実は、重装オペレーターたちからも連絡が入っているんですが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"曰く、こちらに対して攻撃的な人々と遭遇した、とのことでして。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"しかも、その人たちは……感染者だそうです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかりました。重装オペレーターのみなさんには、私たちのいるエリアまで撤退してくるように、と伝えてください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それから、偵察部隊のみなさんは、隠密を基本とし、安全を保った上で、感染者の捜索をお願いします。対象は白い髪をしたウルサス人の女の子で、身長は145cm前後とのことです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"最後に、そのほかのオペレーターは、それぞれの隊長のあとに続いて散開してください。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"囮作戦か。悪くない。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"これは……相手をおびき出すつもりか？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我々は待ち伏せ要員ということかな、フランカ。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"へぇ～……わかってるじゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"リスカム、今の聞いてた？　この人、かなり頭が切れるみたいよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……Dr.{@nickname}はわたしたちの指揮官なんだから、失礼なこと言わないの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――では、行きましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……それにしても、ロドスを狙ってくる感染者……ですか。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ","チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["チェン"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["？？？","ミーシャ"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]}]}
